# Strict Project Rules
- NEVER use Instagram embed iframes (<iframe src=".../embed">). It is strictly forbidden.
- ONLY use native HTML5 <video> elements in 9:16 aspect ratio with custom controls.
- When stream is unavailable, show the Reel cover thumbnail + "Preview unavailable" state + "Open on Instagram" button.
- ZERO placeholder or random fallback videos.
- Treat Instagram CDN .mp4 URLs as temporary session data.
